        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Textile sample of Jacquard-woven silk, wool and cotton. With a design of leaves in golden yellow silk on a brown cotton twill ground. The stems of the leaves, as well as the smaller leaves, are formed by the cotton warp binding the silk weft in tabby, and thus making a texture contrasting with the rest of the ground."@en ;
